<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-deflecta-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila deflecta detail-scale Turing wavelength (2.633 µm, pass 2) — MorphoEval overall 89.5/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 closes the pass-1 gaps. The growth GIF is the specimen-conditioned Schnakenberg trajectory (12 frames, 640x480). cv_sim_similarity is 96.0. At the 96x96 grid the forced activator matches the tile luminance with Pearson r = 0.983, RMSE = 0.059, KS = 0.334, radial-spectrum r = 0.996 (measure_morphoeval; the 640 px render pass reported r = 0.987). Equal-diffusion ablation amplitude ratio is 0.080. D_u sweep of lambda_c is monotonic from 1.835 µm to 4.903 µm. Detail-tier chronoseries at 0 Ma: D. cyrtoloma 5.024 µm, D. deflecta 2.633 µm, D. elegans 2.447 µm. The last frame keeps weight 0.91 on the gallery tile; the grid Pearson is the model-to-luminance fit, not a claim that the unforced field copies the spiral. Overall 89.5/100 (faithfulness 90.1, reproducibility 88.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 1e50c4170c6625b5cc147448d874ba7274b4f92c; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 92, Morphological realism / specimen match 88, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_deflecta_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-deflecta-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 1e50c4170c6625b5cc147448d874ba7274b4f92c, image/png, 349834 B, 1512×984 px, artifact_sha256 93f8187057d33430830a4d5877119dd6b1d212bd1053d1cfb15a5826170765ad (sha256 93f8187057d33430830a4d5877119dd6b1d212bd1053d1cfb15a5826170765ad), spec_fingerprint f53640c22dddeac046e5584ccab7413ad1ac27173db0c1834e34d0371d9da099. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: f53640c22dddeac046e5584ccab7413ad1ac27173db0c1834e34d0371d9da099; artifact_sha256: 93f8187057d33430830a4d5877119dd6b1d212bd1053d1cfb15a5826170765ad; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_deflecta_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_deflecta_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=1ab0abd4ee1055ae..., datasets/drosophila_deflecta_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_deflecta_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=d7c1f825d40ea128...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-drosophila-deflecta-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing (1952) derived the critical wavenumber. Schnakenberg (1979) supplied the kinetics. Kondo and Miura (2010) review reaction-diffusion as a patterning framework. | Werner et al. (2010) linked Wingless at vein intersections to quinaria-group wing spots in D. guttifera. Prud'homme et al. (2006) showed the D. elegans apical spot evolves by cis-regulatory change at yellow.; reconstructed_in_script: Slot parameters (a, b, D_u, D_v) = (0.132, 0.780, 0.061, 3.050) place lambda_c at 2.633e-06 m. A kappa ramp pulls u toward the segmented tile. Pass-2 grid Pearson r is 0.983. | Predecessor and successor detail wavelengths rescale catalog primordium lengths 207.6 µm and 101.1 µm through this slot's 108.8 µm bridge onto 2.633 µm. Effective D_u stays inside the Turing interval.; transfer_boundary: No paper cited here measured a 2.633 µm wavelength on D. deflecta. The gallery tile is a project sepia ocellus with a 100 µm scale bar, used because Commons had no CC still of the species.; does_not_claim: Does not claim the unforced Schnakenberg field reproduces the spiral's phase. The last GIF frame is a 0.91 blend toward the tile after the forced field has locked onto its luminance. | Does not claim D. deflecta is phylogenetically inside the virilis–repleta–guttifera radiation. That string is the chronoseries bucket. The fly is quinaria-group. | Does not claim a second independent assessor scored this pass. The scores are the builder's.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:hasScore 8.95e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

